               <h2>
                Liberal Studies
               </h2>
              </div>
              <div class="resText parbase section">
               <div class="res-text richtextContent background-hidden replica text-font-regular" id="580baccd-f059-4f11-b778-c8443adc3c09">
                <p>
                 Students must take two
                 <a href="/content/ryerson/calendar/2026-2027/liberal-studies/table_a.html">
                  lower level
                 </a>
                 liberal studies courses and two
                 <a href="/content/ryerson/calendar/2026-2027/liberal-studies/table_b.html">
                  upper level
                 </a>
                 liberal studies courses to graduate. Students must not choose courses that are restricted for their program or major.
                </p>
                <p>
                 Please refer to the
                 <a href="/content/ryerson/calendar/2026-2027/liberal-studies.html">
                  liberal studies
                 </a>
                 chapter of this calendar for more information on the Liberal Studies Policy. Further information on liberal studies can also be found at the Faculty of Arts'
                 <span>
                  <a href="/content/ryerson/liberal-studies/" target="_blank">
                   Liberal Studies website
                   <span class="sr-only-no-select">
                    (opens in new window)
